# Always push when ready

When the requested work is complete and the repo has changes:

1. Commit with a concise message that explains why.
2. Push the current branch to origin immediately (`git push -u origin HEAD` if the branch has no upstream).
3. Reply with the live URL: https://ihormich.github.io/ffk/

Do not wait for the user to say «пуш». Skip only if there is nothing to commit, or the user explicitly said not to publish.
